(7541995, 1206815, 101256, '<td valign="top">Second best of the "tangled cables" genre in the challenge - certainly tied with the other 10 in the "tangled cables" genre. Also, the title is perfect - absolutely perfect.</td>', 'Second best of the "tangled cables" genre in the challenge - certainly tied with the other 10 in the "tangled cables" genre. Also, the title is perfect - absolutely perfect.', '2017-11-02 14:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541996, 1207175, 101256, '<td valign="top">I really wanted to mark this down from a 10 to a9, but I can''t even though I would have preferred a little more detail in the clouds and background - however, it is very well done, completely in focus and there really isn''t anything "wrong" with it - great image.</td>', 'I really wanted to mark this down from a 10 to a9, but I can''t even though I would have preferred a little more detail in the clouds and background - however, it is very well done, completely in focus and there really isn''t anything "wrong" with it - great image.', '2017-11-02 14:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541997, 1207191, 101256, '<td valign="top">Interesting image for sure - really like the overall "red" tone and the yellow flash - I assume this is welding wire?  Nicely captured - well done.</td>', 'Interesting image for sure - really like the overall "red" tone and the yellow flash - I assume this is welding wire?  Nicely captured - well done.', '2017-11-02 14:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541998, 1206860, 101256, '<td valign="top">Again, hard to really mark this "down" from a low 10 to a 9, but I think that''s where it belongs. To me, the color looks a little "flat" which may be due to the lack of background detail - and green doesn''t help any.</td>', 'Again, hard to really mark this "down" from a low 10 to a 9, but I think that''s where it belongs. To me, the color looks a little "flat" which may be due to the lack of background detail - and green doesn''t help any.', '2017-11-02 14:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7541999, 1207219, 101256, '<td valign="top">Really like this image - my only critique is that it could be just a touch darker with less contract to make the water more "punchy" if you understand that I mean.  Other than that, very nicely captured.</td>', 'Really like this image - my only critique is that it could be just a touch darker with less contract to make the water more "punchy" if you understand that I mean.  Other than that, very nicely captured.', '2017-11-02 14:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542000, 1207025, 101256, '<td valign="top">Even thought the image is pedestrian in concept, I like the angle and colors and give it a 9 for interest.</td>', 'Even thought the image is pedestrian in concept, I like the angle and colors and give it a 9 for interest.', '2017-11-02 14:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542001, 1206733, 101256, '<td valign="top">I must confess when I first saw this, I wasn''t at all sure what it was. It just looked like two balls of twisted wire on first impression.  I was tempted to just give it a 5 for effort and walk away, but I finally figured it out. Interesting concept and clever. Well done.</td>', 'I must confess when I first saw this, I wasn''t at all sure what it was. It just looked like two balls of twisted wire on first impression.  I was tempted to just give it a 5 for effort and walk away, but I finally figured it out. Interesting concept and clever. Well done.', '2017-11-02 14:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542002, 1206957, 101256, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 9 only because I like the "atmosphere", the colors, the background and the fact that it clearly shows a downhill slope - not an easy thing to portray in a 2D image. Very nice capture.</td>', 'I gave this a 9 only because I like the "atmosphere", the colors, the background and the fact that it clearly shows a downhill slope - not an easy thing to portray in a 2D image. Very nice capture.', '2017-11-02 14:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542003, 1207098, 101256, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 9 because (1) its black and white (2) the bird has remarkable detail (3) sitting in a hole in a fence is something a bird would do - nice capture...well done.</td>', 'I gave this a 9 because (1) its black and white (2) the bird has remarkable detail (3) sitting in a hole in a fence is something a bird would do - nice capture...well done.', '2017-11-02 14:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542004, 1207144, 101256, '<td valign="top">After much thought, I''ve given this a 9 rather than the 7 I started with. I like the overall idea, but once again, I would have preferred a little more detail in the sky and a lighter tree line. Still, I like it a lot - nicely done.</td>', 'After much thought, I''ve given this a 9 rather than the 7 I started with. I like the overall idea, but once again, I would have preferred a little more detail in the sky and a lighter tree line. Still, I like it a lot - nicely done.', '2017-11-02 14:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542005, 1207210, 101256, '<td valign="top">I thought maybe I missed something in my Roman History class in college, but I have just been informed that this is an enemy of Spiderman - who knew?  Now that I "get" it, pretty good - I like it.</td>', 'I thought maybe I missed something in my Roman History class in college, but I have just been informed that this is an enemy of Spiderman - who knew?  Now that I "get" it, pretty good - I like it.', '2017-11-02 14:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542006, 1207215, 101256, '<td valign="top">I like it but it needs more "context" - the image gets lost in the background. Still, it works.</td>', 'I like it but it needs more "context" - the image gets lost in the background. Still, it works.', '2017-11-02 14:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542007, 1207229, 101256, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but a little too "artistic" to make it truly memorable. A simpler approach with more detail or closer in on the frayed ends would have made it a much better image.</td>', 'Interesting, but a little too "artistic" to make it truly memorable. A simpler approach with more detail or closer in on the frayed ends would have made it a much better image.', '2017-11-02 14:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542008, 1206964, 101256, '<td valign="top">At first, I didn''t like this at all - but on second viewing, it started to grow on me and by the time I got to actually writing comments, I began to really appreciate the concept and execution of a very good capture. So....it''s up to a 10.</td>', 'At first, I didn''t like this at all - but on second viewing, it started to grow on me and by the time I got to actually writing comments, I began to really appreciate the concept and execution of a very good capture. So....it''s up to a 10.', '2017-11-02 14:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542011, 1207204, 101256, '<td valign="top">Not sure that this represents,but it is interesting.</td>', 'Not sure that this represents,but it is interesting.', '2017-11-02 15:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542012, 1207018, 101256, '<td valign="top">I believe we''ve entered the land of "barbed wire" genre of images. I''m not overly impressed by this, but the wire is incredibly detailed. I think it might have worked better with a little less background.</td>', 'I believe we''ve entered the land of "barbed wire" genre of images. I''m not overly impressed by this, but the wire is incredibly detailed. I think it might have worked better with a little less background.', '2017-11-02 15:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542013, 1206918, 101256, '<td valign="top">A companion to a previous image, this is interesting and detailed.</td>', 'A companion to a previous image, this is interesting and detailed.', '2017-11-02 15:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542014, 1207028, 101256, '<td valign="top">Kind of an ethereal quality to the image that is very pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'Kind of an ethereal quality to the image that is very pleasing to the eye.', '2017-11-02 15:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542022, 1207230, 101256, '<td valign="top">Image conveys a sense of order and disorder - very interesting capture.</td>', 'Image conveys a sense of order and disorder - very interesting capture.', '2017-11-02 18:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542023, 1207217, 101256, '<td valign="top">A different look at order and disorder - it''s kind of a commentary on how order becomes disorder.</td>', 'A different look at order and disorder - it''s kind of a commentary on how order becomes disorder.', '2017-11-02 18:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542024, 1207173, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and definitely a different look at our interconnected world.</td>', 'Very interesting and definitely a different look at our interconnected world.', '2017-11-02 18:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542025, 1207220, 101256, '<td valign="top">Interesting look at the captivity of animals.</td>', 'Interesting look at the captivity of animals.', '2017-11-02 18:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542026, 1207185, 101256, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what this is, but it looks cool.</td>', 'I have no idea what this is, but it looks cool.', '2017-11-02 18:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542027, 1207224, 101256, '<td valign="top">How many of us have had this happen or even worse in our "spare drawers" or pencil holders?  Very cool.</td>', 'How many of us have had this happen or even worse in our "spare drawers" or pencil holders?  Very cool.', '2017-11-02 18:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542029, 1206927, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very interesting - nearly a perfect conversion - very nice image.</td>', 'Very interesting - nearly a perfect conversion - very nice image.', '2017-11-02 19:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542030, 1207172, 101256, '<td valign="top">I hate to think about this for a minute - from a 7 to a 9 for creativity.</td>', 'I hate to think about this for a minute - from a 7 to a 9 for creativity.', '2017-11-02 19:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542031, 1207137, 101256, '<td valign="top">I like the general "evening" feel to this with the slight bronze tint. Nicely done.</td>', 'I like the general "evening" feel to this with the slight bronze tint. Nicely done.', '2017-11-02 19:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542032, 1206841, 101256, '<td valign="top">The title is a hoot - love it.</td>', 'The title is a hoot - love it.', '2017-11-02 19:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542033, 1206769, 101256, '<td valign="top">I have a mixer board that looks exactly like that.</td>', 'I have a mixer board that looks exactly like that.', '2017-11-02 19:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542034, 1207206, 101256, '<td valign="top">I changed my vote from a 7 to a 9 - I underappreciated the "gestalt" of the image if you will.  Very nice capture.</td>', 'I changed my vote from a 7 to a 9 - I underappreciated the "gestalt" of the image if you will.  Very nice capture.', '2017-11-02 19:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542036, 1206824, 101256, '<td valign="top">I believe that more could have been done with this, but it works as it is. Perhaps a little different angle or perspective might have really worked well. Well done.</td>', 'I believe that more could have been done with this, but it works as it is. Perhaps a little different angle or perspective might have really worked well. Well done.', '2017-11-02 19:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542037, 1206962, 101256, '<td valign="top">I''m not at all sure what the intent was here and I think the reason is in the title, but I can''t parse the idea.</td>', 'I''m not at all sure what the intent was here and I think the reason is in the title, but I can''t parse the idea.', '2017-11-02 19:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542038, 1207228, 101256, '<td valign="top">This would have worked much better with a little tighter or better controlled DOF and focus. A little less contrast might have helped make it a better image in my opinion.</td>', 'This would have worked much better with a little tighter or better controlled DOF and focus. A little less contrast might have helped make it a better image in my opinion.', '2017-11-02 19:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542039, 1207222, 101256, '<td valign="top">I confess - I don''t get it.</td>', 'I confess - I don''t get it.', '2017-11-02 19:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542040, 1207196, 101256, '<td valign="top">Isn''t it amazing at how much steel there is in a electric substation? Nice capture.</td>', 'Isn''t it amazing at how much steel there is in a electric substation? Nice capture.', '2017-11-02 19:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542041, 1207203, 101256, '<td valign="top">I guess this is what it is - and what it is I have no idea.  :)</td>', 'I guess this is what it is - and what it is I have no idea.  :)', '2017-11-02 19:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542042, 1207216, 101256, '<td valign="top">Amazing the amount of wires on the outside of buildings isn''t it?</td>', 'Amazing the amount of wires on the outside of buildings isn''t it?', '2017-11-02 19:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542043, 1207102, 101256, '<td valign="top">Border comment besides the point, this could have worked much better with a little less DOF and a sharper look at the wires.</td>', 'Border comment besides the point, this could have worked much better with a little less DOF and a sharper look at the wires.', '2017-11-02 19:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
